      "description": "Container/service paused state, text usage (e.g. Table.stories.tsx's text-status-paused). Needs the full 4.5:1 AA text floor against white \u2014 orange.500 holds 4.85:1. Not constrained by the dot's isoluminance-vs-status-running requirement, so it can be brighter than the dot (orange.450) despite the lower grade number reading as darker in the ramp's naming.",
